Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.65,0:00:10.17,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.17,0:00:13.51,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Why are you here after four hundred years?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.93,0:00:17.45,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,To see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.94,0:00:20.67,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Nice pickup line.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.39,0:00:25.30,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's obvious that she's just toying with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.30,0:00:27.13,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,{\i1}How infuriating.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.87,0:00:29.14,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,{\i1}And yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.47,0:00:37.68,Default,Valt,0,0,0,,It's time for a new history to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.23,0:02:13.98,Ep Title,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(880,1)}~ Emerging from a Glass Cocoon ~
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.89,0:02:17.78,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,A band of thieves calling themselves \NSaterne has turned up?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.78,0:02:18.70,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.16,0:02:21.78,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,The Saterne are even nastier than the Ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.78,0:02:25.16,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,They kill women and children, \Nas well as burn down cities.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.98,0:02:28.92,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Why don't we have Als take charge here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.92,0:02:30.37,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.64,0:02:37.76,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\i1}That wyvern woman ended up \Ncommitting suicide in custody.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.76,0:02:39.80,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\i1}We still don't know \Nwho spread that animal blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.80,0:02:43.20,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\i1}or who tried to take a shot at Oscar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.55,0:02:47.47,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,What are you doing out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.47,0:02:49.82,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I was taking a walk for a change of scenery.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.82,0:02:51.96,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,You're free to roam the palace grounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.96,0:02:53.44,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Just don't get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.44,0:02:56.98,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,It's fine if I end up lost, \Nsince I can just teleport back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.12,0:02:58.89,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,That hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.89,0:02:59.78,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,What'd I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.17,0:03:03.28,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I leave the castle for \Na fortress inspection in two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.28,0:03:05.16,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Als will be away for other reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.16,0:03:07.24,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,If you need anything, \Nlet us know sooner than later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.42,0:03:09.65,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.65,0:03:11.55,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Should I have moved my schedule back?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.34,0:03:13.71,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Tinasha, why don't you—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.71,0:03:16.36,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Will you be fine going all by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.36,0:03:17.92,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Isn't that dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.83,0:03:21.70,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I can handle myself, unlike you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.70,0:03:23.14,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Be good and stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.41,0:03:24.81,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.81,0:03:26.55,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I'm not a little kid, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.10,0:03:29.73,White-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,400)}Ynureid Fortress    {\fs14}Northwestern Farsas, Bordering Druza
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.23,0:03:32.75,Default-Top,Officer A,0,0,0,,Under General Als's command, we've \Nlargely finished subduing the Saterne.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.27,0:03:36.14,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Things are almost going a little {\i1}too{\i0} smoothly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.14,0:03:36.98,Default,Officer B,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.46,0:03:39.94,Default,Officer B,0,0,0,,The surviving Saterne \Nhave just stormed the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.40,0:03:42.41,Default,Officer B,0,0,0,,They've abducted the Tuldarr princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.16,0:03:47.11,Default,Officer B,0,0,0,,In exchange for the hostage, \Nthey're demanding we hand over Akashia!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.54,0:03:49.04,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,That moron...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.12,0:03:53.21,White-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,Saterne    {\fs14}Band of Armed Thieves
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.70,0:03:56.59,Default,Saterne A,0,0,0,,We nabbed her because \Nshe was just standing there,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.59,0:03:58.38,Default,Saterne A,0,0,0,,but to think she was a princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.38,0:04:01.39,White-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,500)\pos(182,290)}Jarno    {\fs14}Druza Mage, Successor to Molcado
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.76,0:04:01.53,Default-Top,Jarno,0,0,0,,We couldn't have asked for a better hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.53,0:04:04.70,Default,Jarno,0,0,0,,Once Akashia is in our hands, kill that woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.70,0:04:06.69,Default,Jarno,0,0,0,,You'll be paid double once you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.69,0:04:07.28,Default,Saterne B,0,0,0,,Double?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.28,0:04:08.35,Default,Saterne C,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.67,0:04:10.40,Default,Saterne A,0,0,0,,What a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.40,0:04:12.81,Default,Saterne A,0,0,0,,She's the best-looking broad I've ever seen!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.28,0:04:15.55,Default,Jarno,0,0,0,,You can forget that deal if you sell her off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.55,0:04:16.28,Default,Saterne A,0,0,0,,Tsk!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.77,0:04:18.83,Default,Jarno,0,0,0,,That's a sealing ornament \Nfilled with sleeping drugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.83,0:04:20.38,Default,Jarno,0,0,0,,Don't you dare take it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.38,0:04:22.76,Default,Jarno,0,0,0,,Put on as many as you can if you have them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.70,0:04:25.40,Default,Young Man,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.40,0:04:27.21,Default,Jarno,0,0,0,,Just a little insurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.21,0:04:29.29,Default,Jarno,0,0,0,,No matter how powerful a mage you may be,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.29,0:04:32.30,Default,Jarno,0,0,0,,you're susceptible to psychological \Nspells when unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.23,0:04:42.51,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.81,0:04:43.97,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.17,0:04:47.43,Default,Jarno,0,0,0,,Put the sword in its scabbard \Nand throw it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.69,0:04:49.14,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Wake her up first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.59,0:04:51.50,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I can't tell if she's alive or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.54,0:04:53.78,Default,Jarno,0,0,0,,Undo her wrist shackles.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.78,0:04:54.61,Default,Young Man,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.61,0:04:58.03,Default,Jarno,0,0,0,,Even if she wakes up, there are at least \Ntwenty sealing ornaments on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.44,0:05:02.65,Default,Jarno,0,0,0,,Once the sword is ours, \NI'll open up a teleportation portal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.65,0:05:03.77,Default,Jarno,0,0,0,,No need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.42,0:05:10.97,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Ah, my head hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.28,0:05:14.12,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Snap out of it, you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.49,0:05:15.75,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Oscar?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.95,0:05:19.08,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.81,0:05:22.80,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I was just...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.91,0:05:25.12,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.65,0:05:27.01,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.01,0:05:28.42,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,You'd better be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.42,0:05:29.97,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Don't let it happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.97,0:05:32.35,Default,Jarno,0,0,0,,Fork over the sword already!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.76,0:05:36.25,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You kidnapped me to get your hands on Akashia?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.25,0:05:38.04,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,That's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.04,0:05:39.61,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Please take this off me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.61,0:05:41.60,Default,Saterne,0,0,0,,Like hell we would!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.33,0:05:45.58,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Take this off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.01,0:05:48.32,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Otherwise, it'll make it harder \Nto hold back on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.30,0:05:55.21,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,There's no need to hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.21,0:05:57.96,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,They pillage and murder for a living.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.96,0:05:59.46,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.59,0:06:07.22,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I can't aim like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.22,0:06:08.56,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.56,0:06:09.55,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Get back here already.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.85,0:06:14.02,Default,Young Man,0,0,0,,You won't get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.57,0:06:26.78,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Rue your misfortune \Nfor getting involved with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.78,0:06:28.16,Default,Saterne A,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.16,0:06:30.10,Default,Saterne A,0,0,0,,Open the portal!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.28,0:06:41.46,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.02,0:06:46.38,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,It looks like they cast a psychological \Nspell on me, so I'll undo it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.38,0:06:47.87,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,What are you, a cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.87,0:06:49.68,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Don't get dragged away so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.66,0:06:54.98,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,But well, I'm to blame here for \Nallowing them to invade the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.78,0:06:56.64,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.64,0:06:59.08,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Wh-What's gotten into you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.08,0:07:00.85,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,It's not like you to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.85,0:07:02.64,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Are you asking for a cheek pinch?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.64,0:07:04.06,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,No, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.01,0:07:11.53,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Um, if something similar happens again, \Nplease pick Akashia instead of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.53,0:07:13.49,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Don't let it happen again, idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.49,0:07:15.88,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,No, that's not my point.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.88,0:07:19.55,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I'm someone who shouldn't \Nexist in the first place,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.55,0:07:23.14,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,so Tuldarr won't be much worse off without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.81,0:07:26.59,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Don't you treasure your own country?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.97,0:07:29.05,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I care about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.32,0:07:32.11,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Then do a better job \Nunderstanding your own value.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.52,0:07:34.11,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,At least realize that if you're freed,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.11,0:07:38.25,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,you can take Akashia back even if it's stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.80,0:07:40.96,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Oscar...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.16,0:07:43.73,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Rest assured.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.73,0:07:46.30,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I value my kingdom more than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.30,0:07:49.16,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,You just happened to be \Nwithin arm's reach this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.87,0:07:58.87,Default,Jarno,0,0,0,,I didn't think she could shrug off so many \Nsealing ornaments and use her powers...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.20,0:08:03.60,Default,Jarno,0,0,0,,Perhaps we need to eliminate \Nboth Akashia {\i1}and{\i0} that woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.92,0:08:09.71,Default,Jarno,0,0,0,,Still, with so much power, \Nshe'll make a perfect pawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.11,0:08:11.63,Default,Jarno,0,0,0,,The psychological spell I cast—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.63,0:08:13.18,Default,Mila,0,0,0,,What are you up to,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.55,0:08:16.01,Default,Mila,0,0,0,,with that creepy smile on your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.01,0:08:19.47,Default,Mila,0,0,0,,I'll make you a present for my master.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.02,0:08:27.00,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,A shoddily composed spell \Nlike this won't work on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.54,0:08:29.65,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.97,0:08:30.86,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.24,0:08:32.24,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Oscar?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.36,0:08:37.52,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Put some clothes on before you open the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.52,0:08:39.50,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Why must you be like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.50,0:08:41.31,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.97,0:08:46.46,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.46,0:08:47.98,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.98,0:08:50.92,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I broke the hypnosis cast on me \Nwhile I was captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.29,0:08:53.31,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.13,0:08:56.31,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.79,0:09:01.06,Default,Mila,0,0,0,,Lady Tinasha, I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.41,0:09:03.02,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Mila.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.09,0:09:06.23,Default,Mila,0,0,0,,A-Am I interrupting you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.51,0:09:07.85,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Don't mind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.85,0:09:09.21,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Who's that man?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.57,0:09:11.21,Default,Mila,0,0,0,,A present.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.01,0:09:17.74,Default,Mila,0,0,0,,Molcado fled to the east of Tuldarr, \Nor what is now Druza,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.74,0:09:21.12,Default,Mila,0,0,0,,where he was survived by his descendants.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.40,0:09:25.45,Default,Mila,0,0,0,,Members of the Druza royal court are \Nthe ones controlling wyverns at present.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.45,0:09:27.29,Default,Mila,0,0,0,,They're summoning hordes of wyverns,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.29,0:09:29.96,Default,Mila,0,0,0,,and using those souls \Nto create a forbidden curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.96,0:09:34.67,Default,Mila,0,0,0,,Akashia would hinder their invasion of\N Farsas by nullifying the forbidden curse,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.99,0:09:37.98,Default,Mila,0,0,0,,which is why they tried to take it \Naway from you by any means.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.51,0:09:41.02,Default,Mila,0,0,0,,That's all I have to report.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.35,0:09:42.90,Default,Kevin,0,0,0,,A forbidden curse...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.90,0:09:46.31,Default,Kevin,0,0,0,,I can't believe they'd resort \Nto using that for an invasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.58,0:09:49.53,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,It's most likely \Na large-scale destruction spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.53,0:09:54.01,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,But for something a normal human \Nwould be able to handle,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.01,0:09:55.60,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,they'd be limited to five shots at best.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.78,0:09:59.12,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Even if Akashia can counteract it,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.12,0:10:02.54,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,it's hard to say whether its wielder \Ncould survive the aftermath.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.54,0:10:06.75,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You'd most likely need to erect \Na barrier to protect the user.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.45,0:10:09.71,Default,Kevin,0,0,0,,Can I leave it to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.98,0:10:11.17,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.95,0:10:15.13,Default,Kevin,0,0,0,,Let us prepare an army.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.86,0:10:18.59,Default,Kevin,0,0,0,,And you can take the throne as king.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.17,0:10:20.08,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.21,0:10:27.14,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\i1}How will I act when faced with Oscar?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.46,0:10:30.16,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\i1}What are my feelings for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.16,0:10:31.86,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't know the answers to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.18,0:10:35.07,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\i1}However, I know what I must do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.20,0:10:38.86,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\i1}I need to help and protect him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.97,0:11:03.97,White-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,500)\pos(250,290)}Legis    {\fs14}Prince of Tuldarr
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.40,0:11:04.93,Default-Top,Legis,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about my father's \Ndemands the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.93,0:11:10.78,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Your Highness, I'm the reason that \Nthe royal line of succession has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.78,0:11:13.15,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Doesn't that upset you at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.49,0:11:16.94,Default,Legis,0,0,0,,I was never terribly interested in the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.94,0:11:19.41,Default,Legis,0,0,0,,The spirits symbolize Tuldarr royalty,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.41,0:11:22.74,Default,Legis,0,0,0,,so it's only natural that \Ntheir inheritor become our ruler.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.74,0:11:24.72,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.72,0:11:26.32,Default,Legis,0,0,0,,And it's you of all people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.32,0:11:27.59,Default,Legis,0,0,0,,I have no objections.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.22,0:11:31.26,Default,Legis,0,0,0,,If you can't stop worrying \Nabout your succession,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.26,0:11:34.25,Default,Legis,0,0,0,,why don't you try taking \Nan interest in me instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.00,0:11:41.17,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Is that Princess Nephelli of Yarda down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.42,0:11:42.22,Default,Legis,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.22,0:11:45.01,Default,Legis,0,0,0,,They were at war ten years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.01,0:11:48.92,Default,Legis,0,0,0,,but Yarda and Farsas \Nare on excellent terms now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.77,0:11:53.50,Default,Legis,0,0,0,,Your magical power is unstable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.50,0:11:54.10,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.86,0:11:57.20,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.93,0:12:04.98,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Oscar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.62,0:12:07.70,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.70,0:12:09.05,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Is there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.05,0:12:09.80,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.80,0:12:13.90,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I've scanned the hall, \Nand didn't find anyone suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.90,0:12:14.81,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.54,0:12:23.96,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Go back to Tuldarr.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.06,0:12:29.77,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Go back? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.18,0:12:34.62,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You can work on your analysis back in Tuldarr, \Nunless there's something you need here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.62,0:12:37.80,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,You can come visit if you need me, \Nor ask me to make the trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.80,0:12:39.72,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I suppose that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.19,0:12:42.41,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,But what about when you go to war?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.41,0:12:46.40,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Even with Akashia, a human alone \Ncan't withstand a forbidden curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.40,0:12:48.53,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Your country has no say in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.53,0:12:50.12,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,It's none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.12,0:12:52.33,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I promise not to interfere. \NPlease let me stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.33,0:12:53.47,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.47,0:12:55.90,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,What if there's another \Nincident like the last one?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.90,0:12:57.56,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,We've got our hands full as it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.56,0:12:59.67,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I'd rather not have Tuldarr as our enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.02,0:13:01.63,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Return to your country at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.63,0:13:03.13,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Let me stay by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.13,0:13:04.85,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Stop obsessing over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.85,0:13:06.01,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,You're a nuisance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.28,0:13:21.07,Default,Legis,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.67,0:13:24.43,Default,Legis,0,0,0,,Please take a deep breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.43,0:13:25.78,Default,Legis,0,0,0,,Control your magical power.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.06,0:13:28.07,Default,Legis,0,0,0,,It's okay. You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.43,0:13:32.35,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.01,0:13:38.17,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I appreciate everything she's done for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.17,0:13:41.17,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,but I'm sure she has much \Nto prepare for her coronation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.70,0:13:45.88,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Please take this opportunity \Nto have her return to Tuldarr with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.41,0:13:47.91,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Thank you for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.12,0:13:56.52,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I sincerely apologize for my earlier behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.93,0:13:59.38,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,What you say is absolutely correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.20,0:14:04.73,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I cannot thank you enough for all \Nthe generosity you have shown to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.03,0:14:11.52,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,You sent Lady Tinasha back home?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.52,0:14:13.37,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,With those exact words?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.37,0:14:15.42,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,The wording doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.42,0:14:17.08,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,Of course it does!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.08,0:14:19.16,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,That's an awful thing to say to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.16,0:14:21.59,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,What if she refuses to lift your curse?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.59,0:14:23.65,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,She wouldn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.65,0:14:25.11,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,She's got a strong conscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.57,0:14:29.05,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,The worst she'd do is replace it \Nwith another weird curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.05,0:14:32.14,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,Your Highness... I mean, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.14,0:14:35.72,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,Despite all your complaints, \NI thought you'd grown fond of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.72,0:14:37.50,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.50,0:14:40.02,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,She'll eventually be Queen of Tuldarr.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.45,0:14:42.77,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,It's out of my hands, \Nregardless of my personal fondness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.64,0:14:44.54,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,Does that mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.54,0:14:45.92,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Let's focus on the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.70,0:14:50.23,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I'm sick of having her toy with my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.14,0:14:57.63,Default-Top,Old Mage,0,0,0,,Condemn. Lay waste. Consume!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.12,0:15:00.12,White-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,500)}Druza Mage
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.63,0:15:02.09,Default-Top,Old Mage,0,0,0,,My captive souls!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.08,0:15:19.18,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,That leaves three shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.18,0:15:22.15,Default,Kumu,0,0,0,,Not a trace remains \Nof the fortress we used as a decoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.15,0:15:24.70,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Its age meant it was due for rebuilding anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.00,0:15:27.22,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Now then...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.18,0:15:30.78,Default,Old Mage,0,0,0,,Keep going and drive them back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.78,0:15:37.20,Default,Old Mage,0,0,0,,Deal a devastating blow to Farsas here, \Nand we'll secure political power in Druza!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.91,0:15:40.12,Default,Druza Mage,0,0,0,,It's the Farsas army!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.73,0:15:48.81,Default,Als,0,0,0,,Leave him to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.13,0:15:57.54,Default,Als,0,0,0,,Don't let them escape! After them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.54,0:15:58.52,Default,Male Mage,0,0,0,,C'mon, let's run!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.52,0:15:59.93,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Where are the others?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.93,0:16:01.06,Default,Als,0,0,0,,Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.50,0:16:14.59,Default,Male Mage,0,0,0,,Let's run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.59,0:16:16.37,Default,Male Mage,0,0,0,,We'll bide our time and strike again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.37,0:16:17.39,Default,Female Mage,0,0,0,,When?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.39,0:16:20.66,Default,Female Mage,0,0,0,,We can't create another forbidden \Ncurse with our master dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.37,0:16:24.37,Default,Female Mage,0,0,0,,Do you realize how many years this has taken?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.37,0:16:25.33,Default,Male Mage,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.33,0:16:26.69,Default,Male Mage,0,0,0,,You'll take out His Majesty, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.69,0:16:27.79,Default,Male Mage,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.79,0:16:30.33,Default,Female Mage,0,0,0,,Death to Farsas!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.94,0:16:32.68,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.68,0:16:33.84,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,The third one!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.53,0:17:09.32,Default,Kumu,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.32,0:17:10.50,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Can you heal it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.50,0:17:11.80,Default,Kumu,0,0,0,,As a stopgap measure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.80,0:17:12.88,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.91,0:17:14.76,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Ettard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.39,0:17:18.59,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Take a third of our forces \Nand pursue the Druza army.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.59,0:17:20.13,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Have the rest of them withdraw.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.13,0:17:20.86,Default,Ettard,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.63,0:17:25.19,Default,Doan,0,0,0,,The next one's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.19,0:17:27.15,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Two left, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.54,0:17:59.68,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I was sure you hated me by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.68,0:18:01.02,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I do hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.66,0:18:04.64,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I don't want to see your face, \Nso don't turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.49,0:18:16.62,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Why'd you come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.28,0:18:20.66,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Even if you should forget, or I do...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.40,0:18:23.83,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,No matter how many times \Nhistory is reset and changes...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.53,0:18:27.83,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I am your protector.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.73,0:18:30.75,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,That will never change.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.41,0:18:35.67,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,The next one's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.01,0:18:40.49,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,By the way, can you see spell compositions?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.49,0:18:41.30,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,No, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.65,0:18:43.88,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Let me lend you my vision, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.64,0:18:50.32,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Do you see the black circles?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.17,0:18:52.16,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.16,0:18:54.37,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,What about the lines that connect them?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.37,0:18:55.86,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,So I just need to sever those?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.54,0:19:08.14,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Yes, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.78,0:19:25.97,Default,Male Mage,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.22,0:19:29.89,Default,Male Mage,0,0,0,,Releasing that shapeless \Nmagical power would wreak havoc!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.89,0:19:31.33,Default,Female Mage,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.33,0:19:32.56,Default,Female Mage,0,0,0,,Come forth!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.56,0:19:34.15,Default,Female Mage,0,0,0,,Devour everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.85,0:19:46.99,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I don't believe we've met before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.37,0:19:55.21,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I am the twelfth queen of Tuldarr, \NTinasha As Meyer Ur Aeterna Tuldarr.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.21,0:20:01.09,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Are you the ones who have inherited \Nthe spells and crimes of Molcado the convict?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.09,0:20:04.14,Default,Female Mage,0,0,0,,Th-The Witch Killer Queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.51,0:20:07.71,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,If there are no objections, \Nit's time to punish your crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.71,0:20:09.27,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,It all ends here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.69,0:20:17.77,Default,Als,0,0,0,,We have slain King Rodion of Druza, \Nas well as his vassals.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.33,0:20:21.03,Default,Als,0,0,0,,The two forbidden curse mages were found dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.03,0:20:23.10,Default,Als,0,0,0,,We don't know who's responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.10,0:20:24.24,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.75,0:20:27.32,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Assemble the army \Nand send half to the encampment.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.32,0:20:29.22,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Send the other half back to the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.22,0:20:30.70,Default,Als,0,0,0,,Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.19,0:20:34.17,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Tinasha!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.17,0:20:36.16,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I know you're there. Come down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.14,0:20:40.25,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.25,0:20:41.13,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Instinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.67,0:20:44.33,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,How annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.68,0:20:47.71,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Did you forget I didn't want to see your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.71,0:20:49.06,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,That {\i1}does{\i0} ring a bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.54,0:20:53.60,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,You saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.04,0:20:54.98,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.59,0:20:59.63,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,It's nothing to thank me for.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.63,0:21:01.44,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I was just meddling.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.73,0:21:03.66,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I'm thanking you because I want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.23,0:21:07.08,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Also, well... let me apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.08,0:21:08.66,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.66,0:21:10.27,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You don't need to say sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.27,0:21:12.83,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I know I'm clingy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.83,0:21:14.62,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Of course you'd be disgusted.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.62,0:21:17.14,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I don't remember going that far...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.14,0:21:20.38,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Also, I wasn't trying \Nto force you into marriage!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.38,0:21:22.06,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Do you want to marry me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.06,0:21:25.09,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Don't ask me that when you don't even mean it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.09,0:21:26.77,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Hear me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.77,0:21:29.72,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I don't think I should be the only one \Nbeing saved all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.72,0:21:33.54,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Just like you saved me, I'll save you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.97,0:21:35.81,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,So do what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.61,0:21:38.75,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Your room in the palace is the way you left it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.18,0:21:42.65,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Do you think I'll never hate you, \Nno matter what you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.13,0:21:45.78,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,That I'll always come running back?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.78,0:21:47.31,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.31,0:21:48.87,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,You don't want to see my face, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.23,0:21:52.24,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.24,0:21:55.25,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I'm prepared for you to toy with my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.81,0:21:58.58,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I'll stay within arm's reach of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.93,0:22:01.29,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,You've already toyed with me plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.29,0:22:03.36,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.47,0:23:40.02,Next Ep Title,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,1)}~ Unanswered Prayer ~
